  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Alorman Developed schools provide high quality school education to rural children in Egypt who cannot otherwise access or afford it. The schools adopt a nurturing, holistic approach to education, helping children learn joyfully. 64% of the children get full equal treatment. Your donation goes towards critical infrastructure like learning material classrooms, school bus, etc. for 10 Alorman developed  rural schools &amp; Govt. Schools Support Program.</narrative>
